  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to ECDPM 2020-2021

Firstly, the grant will provide core support to ECDPM to link policy and practice in European development and international cooperation and produce high quality and independent research. Secondly, the grant will provide support to independent advice and assistance to DMFA on Danish priority issues.</narrative>
